                                   '- excluded\n'
                                   '- context\n'
                                   '\n'
                                   'A piece explicitly marked with a cross or strike-through has role "excluded".\n'
                                   '\n'
                                   'An otherwise visible piece that does not belong to the identified product or '
                                   'matching set has role "context".\n'
                                   '\n'
                                   'Use visible evidence, product category, design consistency, composition, and '
                                   'printed product information to determine membership.\n'
                                   '\n'
                                   'Do not assume every item in a staged photograph belongs to the product set.\n'
                                   '\n'
                                   'FURNITURE SET RULES\n'
                                   '\n'
                                   'Bedroom sets may include beds, nightstands, dressers, matching mirrors, chests of '
