                                   '\n'
                                   'A bed is one physical furniture piece, including its headboard, footboard, and '
                                   'rails.\n'
                                   '\n'
                                   'A wall mirror above or beside the matching dresser is product.\n'
                                   '\n'
                                   'A lounge chair, accent chair, or bench in a bedroom photo is context unless it '
