                                   '\n'
                                   'PIECE INVENTORY\n'
                                   '\n'
                                   'Create one entry for every separate visible physical product piece.\n'
                                   '\n'
                                   'List context objects once per kind; list every excluded piece.\n'
                                   '\n'
                                   'Do not count an inset, alternate angle, reflection, mirrored view, diagram, or '
