                                   '\n'
                                   'Do not infer the geometry of hidden areas.\n'
                                   '\n'
                                   'COUNTING\n'
                                   '\n'
                                   'count_by_kind includes role "product" only.\n'
                                   '\n'
                                   'Counts must agree exactly with the pieces array.\n'
                                   '\n'
                                   'Count visible physical pieces independently of printed quantities.\n'
                                   '\n'
                                   'Record printed quantities separately in printed_counts.\n'
                                   '\n'
                                   'If printed quantities contradict the visible inventory, record the discrepancy in '
