                                   '\n'
                                   'DESIGN LOCKS\n'
                                   '\n'
                                   'Record up to 10 distinctive visible product details, such as silhouette, '
                                   'proportions, upholstery pattern, stitching, seams, piping, trims, legs, arm shape, '
                                   'hardware, and visible construction features.\n'
                                   '\n'
                                   'Include the observed colour of each relevant detail.\n'
                                   '\n'
                                   'Record only what the photograph supports.\n'
                                   '\n'
                                   'SIDED PARTS\n'
                                   '\n'
                                   'Record product pieces with a visible left or right configuration, such as a '
