                                   '\n'
                                   'State the hand as seen when facing the piece (left-arm facing or right-arm facing) '
                                   'and, separately, its position in the image.\n'
                                   '\n'
                                   'The hand must never be mirrored. Do not infer handedness when it cannot be '
                                   'established.\n'
                                   '\n'
                                   'RELATIONSHIPS\n'
                                   '\n'
                                   'Describe up to 5 visible relationships between product pieces, for example two '
